# clones

> HTML shelf named clones. Separate from barrage-clones (the wave hub).

## Purpose
Give a plain-language door to fitzyracing1/clones.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the original repo as the place for files.
2. Use this clone to explain the idea.
3. Send the reader to barrage-clones if they want the wave hub.

## Key ideas
- clones (the named shelf)
- HTML source
- Not barrage-clones

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/clones
open_source()
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. open_source() → “go to fitzyracing1/clones”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants the wave index → barrage-clones

## What a person would notice
A named wrap on an older clones door.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the source, or barrage-clones.
